 "final_summary": "The bug was caused by a strict inequality (`>=`) in the title length validation that rejected titles of exactly 120 characters. The fix changed the condition to `>` in the `_clean_title` function, allowing titles of exactly 120 characters to be accepted. The updated validation logic now correctly handles the boundary case.",
